<section>

<h2>About Us</h2>

<p>
Faith Holiness Community Development Corporation (Faith Holiness CDC)
is committed to empowering lives and transforming communities through
education, outreach, advocacy, and partnerships.
</p>

</section>

<section>

<h2>Our Mission</h2>

<p>
We connect youth, adults, seniors and families with resources that
promote housing, employment, education, mental wellness, community
engagement and spiritual support.
</p>

